===A6_S3_D2===
// collider around the corner
Narrator: A cliff has indeed collapsed, fallen onto the beach and a bit of the ocean.
Narrator: A large chunk of earth stays intact with itself — like a giant rock. Which is what a group of Ichthyos and Krakenfolk are attempting to pry off the water.
Narrator: Your stomach lurches as you realize there are people trapped underneath. Perhaps there was an underwater cove or cave?
Amelia: Let’s go and help them! #portrait:AmeliaHostile
Narrator: You dive into the water, joining the group who are coordinating to push and pull in sync.
Narrator: …But the rock doesn’t budge.
Noelle: (Maybe…) #portrait:NoelleUm
Narrator: You quickly tell the person next to you that you’ll be back with something to help. #portrait:Saorise
Amelia: Noelle…? I know you're thinking of something strange again. Spit it out. #portrait:AmeliaSilly
Noelle: Something needs to be wedged in between the rock and the beach. Otherwise, we’ve got no chance of moving it with our own strength. #portrait:NoelleSkeptical
Amelia: But something big enough to do that surely can’t be lugged here, either. #portrait:AmeliaShut
Narrator: You smile, a little warily.
Noelle: I think I know what we can use. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
-> DONE